   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A SITUATION\ne.g. \"my health is bad\", \"my crops died\".\nUnderstand the situation, put the facts\ntogether, find the schemes that help, and\nguide them on what to do, from the\nsystem's own info.",
